        Real-world, fully tested open-source applications built with BirFramework:
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <a href="https://github.com/ferdisahin/BirFramework" target="_blank" class="block p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition">
          <div class="font-semibold text-sm text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">bir-blog</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1">Full publishing platform with auth, posts, comments, and .bir templates.</div>
        </a>

        <a href="https://github.com/ferdisahin/BirFramework" target="_blank" class="block p-4 rounded-lg border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 hover:border-zinc-400 dark:hover:border-zinc-600 transition">
          <div class="font-semibold text-sm text-zinc-950 dark:text-white">bir-saas</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-zinc-500 mt-1">Subscription billing, metered developer API keys, and automated invoices.</div>
